# Build and release

- When running **dotnet restore**, **dotnet publish**, or **./build_release.sh** in this repo, use **full permissions** (`required_permissions: ["all"]`). The sandbox can block NuGet (SSL/certificate access), causing NU1301 and hiding real build errors.
- Release zip lives in `jfresolve-10.11/jfresolve.zip`. Update `repository.json` checksum for the built version with the MD5 printed by `build_release.sh`.
